    "MissionGiver": "Eckhart Security",
    "Title": "Alliance Aid: Thwart Cargo-jacking",
    "TitleKey": "CleanAir_RecoverCargo_Hard_title",
    "Description": "ECKHART SECURITY, LLC.\nCONTRACTS & DISPATCH\n\nCONTRACT TYPE: Cargo Retrieval \nAPPROVAL CODE = JJ-13\n\nFOR IMMEDIATE PROCESSING\n\nAlliance Aid just comm'd in a panic. A vital shipment that they were counting on hasn't shown up. All signs point to it getting jacked by thieves along the way so they're counting on us to make sure it gets delivered.  \n\nYou're going to head to the <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4>, assess the situation, <EM4>neutralize any remaining hostiles</EM4> in the area, and secure the shipment for drop off at <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>. Be sure to have a <EM4>few support ships</EM4> with you just in case things get extra rough. \n\nBe sure to bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> to handle the cargo.  \n\nThis contract is non-negotiable.\n\nThis message may contain confidential, proprietary, privileged and/or private information. The information is intended to be for the use of the individual or entity designated above.",
    "DescriptionKey": "CleanAir_RecoverCargo_Hard_desc",
    "DisplayDescription": "ECKHART SECURITY, LLC.\nCONTRACTS & DISPATCH\n\nCONTRACT TYPE: Cargo Retrieval \nAPPROVAL CODE = JJ-13\n\nFOR IMMEDIATE PROCESSING\n\nAlliance Aid just comm'd in a panic. A vital shipment that they were counting on hasn't shown up. All signs point to it getting jacked by thieves along the way so they're counting on us to make sure it gets delivered.  \n\nYou're going to head to the <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4>, assess the situation, <EM4>neutralize any remaining hostiles</EM4> in the area, and secure the shipment for drop off at <EM4>Levski</EM4>. Be sure to have a <EM4>few support ships</EM4> with you just in case things get extra rough. \n\nBe sure to bring a <EM4>handheld tractor beam</EM4> to handle the cargo.  \n\nThis contract is non-negotiable.\n\nThis message may contain confidential, proprietary, privileged and/or private information. The information is intended to be for the use of the individual or entity designated above.",
